<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Title>MiHomeLib</Title>
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.0;net461;net462;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <PackageId>MiHomeLib</PackageId>
    <MinClientVersion>2.6</MinClientVersion>
    <Authors>Sergey Brutsky</Authors>
    <Description>C# library for using xiaomi/aqara smart gateways/devices in your scenarios</Description>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>false</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
3.3.1
- Fixed: a miIO request no longer fails when a corrupted or non-miIO datagram arrives before the device answer; such datagrams are skipped. When only answers with an invalid checksum arrive (usually a wrong token), the request still fails with the checksum error, now after the response timeout instead of immediately.
- Extended robustness tests: invalid values for every mapped value of every supported device, seeded random MQTT packets, and long or corrupted miIO datagrams.
- The 3.3.0 public API is recorded as shipped, and package validation now compares against 3.3.0. No public API changes.
- The MiotProperty generator is documented as a tool for new MIoT devices; existing devices keep their hand-written methods.
- Known limitation: malformed SQLite databases still throw InvalidDataException.

Supported targets: .NET Standard 2.0, .NET Framework 4.6.1 and 4.6.2, and .NET 10.

Gateway setup guide: https://github.com/sergey-brutsky/mi-home/wiki/Gateway-Setup
Worker Service guide: https://github.com/sergey-brutsky/mi-home/wiki/Worker-Service
When upgrading from 2.x, review the 3.0 breaking changes and migration guide:
Release notes: https://github.com/sergey-brutsky/mi-home/wiki/Release-Notes-3.0
Migration guide: https://github.com/sergey-brutsky/mi-home/wiki/Migration-3.0
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageDescription Condition="'$(UseReadmeAsPackageDescription)' == 'true'">$([System.IO.File]::ReadAllText('$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)/README.md'))</PackageDescription>
    <Copyright>Copyright 2017-2026 (c) Sergey Brutsky. All rights reserved.</Copyright>
    <PackageTags>xiaomi aqara xiaomi-smart-home xiaomi-gateway2 multimode-gateway multimode-gateway2 smarthome 
    csharp netstandard2 netcore2 mihome</PackageTags>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/sergey-brutsky/mi-home</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageIcon>gateway.jpeg</PackageIcon>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>false</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <Version>3.3.1</Version>
    <LangVersion>14</LangVersion>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CS1591</NoWarn>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <EnablePackageValidation>true</EnablePackageValidation>
    <PackageValidationBaselineVersion>3.3.0</PackageValidationBaselineVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(GITHUB_ACTIONS)' == 'true'">
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild>true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'net461'">
    <!-- The packaged library passed a smoke test on .NET Framework 4.6.1. -->
    <SuppressTfmSupportBuildWarnings>true</SuppressTfmSupportBuildWarnings>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'net10.0'">
    <IsAotCompatible>true</IsAotCompatible>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.PublicApiAnalyzers" Version="3.3.4">
      <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
      <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers</IncludeAssets>
    </PackageReference>
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <AdditionalFiles Include="PublicAPI.Shipped.txt" />
    <AdditionalFiles Include="PublicAPI.Unshipped.txt" />
    <ProjectReference Include="../MiHomeLib.Generators/MiHomeLib.Generators.csproj"
                      OutputItemType="Analyzer" ReferenceOutputAssembly="false" PrivateAssets="all" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" Version="8.0.2" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' != 'net10.0'">
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Bcl.AsyncInterfaces" Version="8.0.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Diagnostics.DiagnosticSource" Version="8.0.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Json" Version="8.0.5" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="gateway.jpeg" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\"/>
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
